6️⃣ Example Wrapper Pattern (Advanced)
public class BrowsingTheWeb implements Ability {

    private BrowseTheWeb browseTheWeb;

    private BrowsingTheWeb(WebDriver driver) {
        this.browseTheWeb = BrowseTheWeb.with(driver);
    }

    public static BrowsingTheWeb with(WebDriver driver) {
        return new BrowsingTheWeb(driver);
    }

    public WebDriver getDriver() {
        return browseTheWeb.getDriver();
    }
}


Cucumber Tag Expressions — Detailed Cheat Sheet 

| Condition | Expression              | Description                                         | When to Use                        | Example Scenario Result         |
| --------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| AND       | `@a and @b`             | Runs scenarios that contain **both tags together**  | When you want very specific subset | Only scenarios having both tags |
| OR        | `@a or @b`              | Runs scenarios that contain **any one of the tags** | When combining multiple groups     | Scenarios with either tag       |
| NOT       | `not @a`                | Excludes scenarios that contain the tag             | Skip unstable / WIP tests          | Everything except that tag      |
| AND + NOT | `@a and not @b`         | Runs scenarios with one tag but excludes another    | Smoke without slow tests           | Specific include + exclude      |
| OR + NOT  | `(@a or @b) and not @c` | Combines groups but removes unwanted ones           | Regression minus failures          | Large suite filtering           |


